    "q-333129": {
      "dom_id": "step-q333129",
      "name": "Question 12",
      "problem": "$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}^{′}(t)=3{x}_{1}(t)-3 \\\\ {x}_{2}^{′}(t)={x}_{1}(t)+{x}_{2}(t)-3,\\end{aligned}\\,x(0)=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nConsider the initial value problem above. By applying the Laplace transform to both sides of each equation in our system, we get a transformed system with the solution \n\n$$\n{X}_{1}(s)=L\\{{x}_{1}(t)\\}=\\frac{2}{s-3}+\\frac{1}{s},\\,{X}_{2}(s)=L\\{{x}_{2}(t)\\}=\\frac{1}{s-3}-\\frac{3}{s-1}+\\frac{2}{s}.\n$$\n\nFind the solution to the original initial value problem.\n\n<table align=\"l\" cellpadding=\"0\" rules=\"all\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" height=\"35px\" align=\"center\">$x(t)=\\,\\,$</td>\n<td width=\"5px\" height=\"40px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-1}}</td>\n<td width=\"5px\" align=\"center\"></td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" height=\"40px\" align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n\n<tr>\n<td width=\"5px\" height=\"35px\"></td>\n<td align=\"center\">{{field-2}}</td>\n<td align=\"center\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
      "worked_solution": "To find ${x}_{1}(t)$ and ${x}_{2}(t)$ satisfying the original initial value problem, we apply the inverse Laplace transform to ${X}_{1}(s)$ and ${X}_{2}(s):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}(t) & ={L}^{-1}\\{{X}_{1}(s)\\} \\\\  & ={L}^{-1}\\{\\frac{2}{s-3}+\\frac{1}{s}\\} \\\\  & =2\\,{L}^{-1}\\{\\frac{1}{s-3}\\}+{L}^{-1}\\{\\frac{1}{s}\\} \\\\  & =2{e}^{3\\cdot t}+1 \\\\  & =2{e}^{3t}+1 \\\\ {x}_{2}(t) & ={L}^{-1}\\{{X}_{2}(s)\\} \\\\  & ={L}^{-1}\\{\\frac{1}{s-3}-\\frac{3}{s-1}+\\frac{2}{s}\\} \\\\  & ={L}^{-1}\\{\\frac{1}{s-3}\\}-3\\,{L}^{-1}\\{\\frac{1}{s-1}\\}+2\\,{L}^{-1}\\{\\frac{1}{s}\\} \\\\  & ={e}^{3\\cdot t}-3{e}^{1\\cdot t}+2\\cdot 1 \\\\  & ={e}^{3t}-3{e}^{t}+2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we write down the solution to the initial value problem:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x(t) & =[\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}(t) \\\\ {x}_{2}(t)\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}2{e}^{3t}+1 \\\\ {e}^{3t}-3{e}^{t}+2\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
